OL,3,GNEWSAKitten dies after being abandoned
OL,4,Ain a box
OL,5,
OL,6,FA days old kitten has died after being
OL,7,Ffound abandoned in a box on a cycle
OL,8,Ftrack.
OL,10,FFriends of the Animals, a charity based
OL,11,Fin Newport, Isle of Wight, said it
OL,12,Freceived a message from The Veterinary
OL,13,FHospital on Riverway to say a member of
OL,14,Fthe public had found two kittens in a
OL,15,Fbox on the cycle track between Cowes
OL,16,Fand Newport.
OL,18,FHelen Luff from the charity said the
OL,19,Fkittens, named Scooter and Vespa by vet
OL,20,Fstaff, were found on Sunday but Vespa
OL,21,Fdied on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
