OL,3,GNEWSAKitten dies after being abandoned
OL,4,Ain a box
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the kittens were "full of
OL,7,Ffleas", some "half the size of a
OL,8,Ffingernail", and added that the
OL,9,Fkittens, which she believes were about
OL,10,F10-14 days old when they were found,
OL,11,Fhad "no immune system".
